  "5b52a951-925a-4db4-a28f-9bc6cb5fde91"],
 " grids keep the rim vertices as pendants. Near the pendants some rays have \
no neighbour over a base edge, so the tangent bundle at scale 2 is not a \
fibration there. On the full grid it is:"
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"f96b1f85-230a-4242-8242-95b36b11c6d9"],

